  "interpretation": {
    "common_cell_result": "Across nine common recorded-subtype by result-family cells covering 99.90% of early and 99.94% of late eligible events, the Fly shift is +0.51 percentage points: -11.51 points from cell composition and +12.02 points from within-cell conditional mapping.",
    "main_conditional_changes": "Within recorded Fly, canonical Fly rises from about 60% in 2015/2019 to about 79-80% in 2023/2025. The largest common cells change in the same direction: out-in-play +20.44 points, hit +18.26, and sacrifice +16.98.",
    "recorded_mix_change": "Recorded Fly falls from 66.10% in 2015/2019 to 47.88% in 2023/2025 while recorded PopUp rises from 1.45% to 13.49%.",
    "source_relationship": "Exact local recorded subtype agreement with Statcast bb_type is 74.02% in 2015, 77.28% in 2019, and 100% in 2023 and 2025 among eligible rows.",
    "target_measurement_dependence": "Baseball Savant documents estimated launch angle and exit velocity for a limited untracked subset. Its linked Statcast processing explanation says estimates can use stringer labels and actual outcomes, with different assignments for tracking outages and misses while the tracking system remains operational. Recorded subtype and result can therefore overlap target-imputation inputs; the accepted frame has no row-level observed-versus-estimated flag.",
    "tracking_transition": "Hawk-Eye was deployed at all MLB parks for the 2020 season, between the two fitted era groups. This temporal alignment motivates an explicit measurement-regime analysis but does not identify the cause of the mapping shift.",
    "target_mix_change": "The canonical angle target changes much less: Fly rises from 40.92% to 41.37%, LineDrive falls from 42.93% to 41.45%, and PopUp rises from 16.15% to 17.18%."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "The 373 games are a balanced fitting collection and do not estimate league prevalence.",
    "All results use already exposed fitting labels and cannot serve as independent confirmation.",
    "The canonical target is observed only when local broad type is Air and the angle target resolves; selection into that population may vary by season.",
    "Numeric launch angle is not necessarily an independent measurement because Savant includes vendor-estimated values for some untracked contact and the accepted frame has no per-row measured-versus-estimated flag.",
    "The source data alone do not identify whether era changes arise from tracking hardware, upstream classification, park, scorer, or another process.",
    "A year indicator cannot identify source mechanism, label authorship, or historical transport.",
    "The 121 modern-angle evaluation games, historical confirmation reserve, TEST, VALIDATE, and reserve labels remain unread here.",
    "Bootstrap intervals are paired game-cluster development intervals conditional on fixed training fits."
  ],
  "next_action": "Do not promote or tune the pooled translation. Specify and freeze a source- and measurement-regime experiment that distinguishes measured from vendor-estimated angles where provenance permits and establishes recorded-label authorship before assigning scorer effects. A year indicator alone is insufficient. Retain unresolved/source-conflict cases before opening independent evaluation.",
